IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MOONCAKE-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFILL-CLUSTERS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-CLUSTERS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TOTAL-CLUSTERS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MOONCAKE-V2.
    IF PREFILL-CLUSTERS == 0 OR DECODE-CLUSTERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PREFILL-CLUSTERS TO TOTAL-CLUSTERS.
    ADD DECODE-CLUSTERS TO TOTAL-CLUSTERS.
    MOVE 365 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-CLUSTERS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
